    "text": "By Will Stafford ,\n1 hours ago LYNCHBURG, Va. (WSET/Lynchburg Hornets) — The Lynchburg men's basketball team collected its fourth win in five games with an assertive 81–53 victory over the Randolph Wildcats in its first ODAC matchup of the year. Jamarcus Brown led the way for the Hornets (5–3) with 18 points on 8-of-16... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
